/E (Period poverty is often discussed as an issue of access, but another reality is rarely spoken about. Most traditional period products contain large amounts of plastic, leaving an environmental footprint that lasts far beyond a single month. For young people growing up in a climate crisis, this matters. Dignity should not come with long-term damage to the planet.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [7]
>>
