/E (Communities are increasingly recognising that period dignity and sustainability must be addressed together. Providing free products matters, but so does the type of product provided. Biodegradable alternatives offer a more responsible path forward, supporting girls and women while reducing long-term waste. This shift allows schools, youth centres, and public spaces to meet real needs without adding to a growing environmental burden.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [9]
>>
